Version 4.0 covers sui generis database rights as well as copyright, which is
why it is used here: the individual facts in these files are not themselves
owned by anyone, but the selection, verification and arrangement of them is
the work this license applies to.

Note on the underlying sources: every record links to material published
elsewhere — posts, articles, broadcasts — and this license does not grant any
right in that linked material. It covers this dataset's own records and
structure, not the content they point at.

